<figcaption class="ltx_caption"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 7: </span>Results on NeuCLIR cross-lingual benchmarks <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_citep">(<a href="#bib.bib21" title="" class="ltx_ref">Lawrie et al., 2024</a>)</cite> on three languages (Chinese, Persian, and Russian). The Avg. MLIR score (nDCG@20) is the mean across the two years. Our 560M MILCO model outperforms Qwen3 0.6B, but falls behind PALID-X and Qwen3-Embed 4B/8B. PLAID-X focuses exclusively on the test languages. </figcaption>
